description	"Grand Moff Wilhuff Tarkin 

A backline commander who builds resource through damage to bolster his allies and himself.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% slower RoF
- Tarkin's Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Pushes on hit
-- 15% more damage/FP damage
-- 15% more velocity
-- 15% slower RoF
- Test Fire (1) (PLX)
-- Decimates on det
-- 75% more damage
-- 500% slower reload 
-- Heavyweight 
- Fire Grenades (2)
- V-59 Conc Grenades (2)

^5Powers:
- Team Energize (2)
- Protect (1) ^9{Dark's Beacon}

^6Inventory:
- Defense Seeker ^3[CS2]
- Interrogator Droid (Support Beacon)
- Forcefield ^3[CS4]
- Advanced Medpac ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- 50% slower skill cooldown
- Fury (3)
-- Regen: 1/.1s to 10
-- 99% slower decay
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- Ally Stat Viewer

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"